      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HALLEBESOFINE (4) drew wider than this and did some work when fifth as favourite in the Need For Speed Princess last week. She has been racing very consistently with a string of wins or placings prior and the longer trip should suit having finished second in the Vicbred final the last time she attempted this trip. Worth another chance from a better draw. ALDEBARAN ADA (1) drew wider and had to work so was brave when sticking on for second here last week. Should enjoy the favours from the ace draw so is a big chance to go one better. HARPERSEVEN (8) beat many of these when winning the Need For Speed Princess last week. Up in distance and draws on the back row but can track ALDEBARAN ADA earlier and could be dangerous again. ADELAIDE RED (9) worked last start so it may pay to be forgiving. Was racing well prior including a win here and a placing in the Vicbred Final so respect.",
